ION IN THE CURRENT QUARTER.QTRLY NON-COMPENSATION EXPENSES $3.02 BILLION VERSUS $2.81 BILLION REPORTED LAST YEAR.QTRLY TRADING REVENUES $4.68 BILLION VERSUS $2.73 BILLION REPORTED LAST YEAR.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $1.12, REVENUE VIEW $10.31 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA."}{'symbol': 'NCLH', 'date': '2020-07-16 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'NCL Corp Ltd Reports Proposed Offering Of Senior Secured Notes', 'text': 'NCL CORPORATION LTD. ANNOUNCES PROPOSED OFFERING OF SENIOR SECURED NOTES AND EXCHANGEABLE NOTES.NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE - NCL CORPORATION PROPOSING TO SELL $675 MILLION OF ITS SENIOR SECURED NOTES DUE 2026.NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE - NCLC TO USE NET PROCEEDS FROM OFFERINGS OF NOTES TO REPAY $675.0 MILLION SENIOR SECURED REVOLVING CREDIT FACILITY.'}{'symbol': 'PEP', 'date': '2020-07-16 18:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'PepsiCo Declares Quarterly Dividend Of $1.0225 Per Share', 'text': 'PEPSICO INC - DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.0225 PER SHARE.'}{'symbol': 'PG', 'date': '2020-07-16 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'P&G Will Make Operations Carbon Neutral For Decade', 'text': "P&G - WILL MAKE OPERATIONS CARBON NEUTRAL FOR DECADE.P&G - REDUCING GHG EMISSIONS BY 50% AND PURCHASING 100% RENEWABLE ELECTRICITY FOR ALL MANUFACTURING SITES BY 2030.P&G - 'ADVANCING NATURAL CLIMATE SOLUTIONS THAT DELIVER A CARBON BENEFIT EQUAL TO REMAINING GHG EMISSIONS FROM OPERATIONS'."}{'symbol': 'TWTR', 'date': '2020-07-16 14:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Twitter Says Given Security Incident On Wednesday, Co Pausing Twitter API Launch Planned For Thursday - Blog', 'text': 'TWITTER SAYS GIVEN SECURITY INCIDENT ON WEDNESDAY, CO PAUSING TWITTER API LAUNCH PLANNED FOR THURSDAY - BLOG.TWITTER SAYS FOUND NO EVIDENCE THE INCIDENT HAD ANYTHING TO DO WITH API, BUT DECIDED TO MOVE THE LAUNCH TO MORE APPROPRIATE TIME.'}{'symbol': 'UNH', 'date': '2020-07-16 08:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Unitedhealth Group Continues Efforts To Combat Covid-19, Reports Q2 Results', 'text': 'UNITEDHEALTH GROUP CONTINUES EFFORTS TO COMBAT COVID-19, REPORTS SECOND QUARTER PERFORMANCE.SEES FY 2020 EARNINGS PER SHARE $15.45 TO $15.75.Q2 2020 NET EARNINGS AND ADJUSTED NET EARNINGS PER SHARE OF $6.91 AND $7.12.Q2 2020 REVENUES INCREASED $1.5 BILLION TO $62.1 BILLION.Q2 MEDICAL CARE RATIO WAS IMPACTED BY TEMPORARY DEFERRAL OF CARE DUE TO PANDEMIC, DECLINING TO 70.2% FROM 83.1% LAST YEAR.SEES FY 2020 ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE $16.25 TO $16.55.EXPECTS MEDICAL CARE RATIO TO RISE IN COMING QUARTERS AS NEEDED CARE IS ACCESSED.UNITEDHEALTH -EXPECTS RESULTS WILL BE OFFSET IN QUARTERS AHEAD BY ASSISTANCE MEASURES ALREADY TAKEN, RESUMPTION OF DEFERRED CARE, FUTURE COVID-19 COST.UNITEDHEALTH GROUP - OPTUM SECOND QUARTER REVENUE & OPERATING EARNINGS OF $32.7 BILLION & $2.2 BILLION RESPECTIVELY ADVANCED FROM $28.0 BILLION & $2.1 BILLION A YEAR AGO.UNITEDHEALTH - AS PANDEMIC ADVANCED, ACCESS TO AND DEMAND FOR CARE WAS MOST CONSTRAINED FROM MID-MARCH THROUGH APRIL.UNITEDHEALTH - DEMAND FOR CARE BEGAN TO RECOVER IN MAY AND APPROACHED MORE TYPICAL LEVELS BY END OF Q2.MAINTAINING ITS FULL YEAR EARNINGS PER SHARE OUTLOOK FOR 2020.EXPECT ANOTHER $1 BILLION IN REBATES TO BE PAID IN FUTURE PERIODS.UNITEDHEALTH - PROVIDED $1.5 BILLION IN DIRECT CUSTOMER AND CONSUMER SUPPORT THROUGH PREMIUM CREDITS, COST-SHARING WAIVERS AND OTHER EFFORTS.ANNOUNCED THAT WE WILL NOT REQUEST, NOR DO WE INTEND TO RETAIN, ANY GOVERNMENT ASSISTANCE.'}{'symbol': 'DIS', 'date': '2020-07-16 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Disney Parks, Experiences And Products Names Jill Estorino President And Managing Director Of Disney Parks International- Blog', 'text': ':DISNEY PARKS, EXPERIENCES AND PRODUCTS NAMES JILL ESTORINO PRESIDENT AND MANAGING DIRECTOR OF DISNEY PARKS INTERNATIONAL'}